message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below, and also cite the works listed under references."
type: software
title: "Cross-checking a rebuild of Guo, Liu, and Wang (2022) with Yang et al.'s (2016) multilevelMatching package"
abstract: "An R rebuild of the simulation studies in Guo, Liu, and Wang (2022), covariate matching and generalized propensity score matching for multilevel treatments, cross-checked replication by replication against the R package multilevelMatching that implements the matching estimators of Yang et al. (2016). Derived from the repository glw2022-matching-replication."
